    "id": "nokia-3310",
    "name": {
      "zh": "Nokia 3310",
      "en": "Nokia 3310"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Nokia 3310 是诺基亚 2000 年推出的直板功能机，以耐摔耐用、Xpress-on 可换壳与贪吃蛇 II 成为史上最畅销手机之一，是 GSM 短信时代的国民神话。",
      "en": "The Nokia 3310, launched in 2000, became one of the best-selling phones of all time with its rugged durability, Xpress-on covers and Snake II, a national legend of the GSM era."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 2000,
    "manufacturer": "Nokia",
    "category": "phone",
    "description": "Nokia 3310（2000），GSM 2G 数字功能机：单色 LCD 84×48（需核实）、SMS 短信、Xpress-on 换壳、贪吃蛇 II、可拆电池，销量约 1.26 亿部。演示向（Symbian/MAME 预留）。",
    "authors": [
